  ],
  "conclusion": "$\\mathcal{Z}_{\\beta}(\\rho):=\\sup_{\\{p_i,\\phi_i\\}}\\sum_{i\\in[m]}p_i\\,\\mathcal{Z}_{\\beta}(\\phi_i)$, and $\\mathcal{Z}_{\\beta}(\\rho)=\\mathcal{Z}_{\\beta}({\\rm STAB})$ iff $\\rho$ admits a decomposition into pure stabilizer states.",
